edition ObjectiveBend 1
# Step 3b tooth: an open extension is checked against its binder ALONE. It reads self.z,
# which its Self bound does not declare: refused at the declaration, whatever selves it
# would later be closed at.

extension Bad[Self has {x: Nat}, Super has {x: Nat}](self: Self, super: Super) -> Super with {y: Nat}:
  extend(super, {y: self.z})

def zero() -> Nat:
  0n
